  "speech": [],
  "notes": "Person boxes drafted by Claude from one frame per second plus the last frame; reviewed by eduardo on 2026-11-15 against an overlay of every keyframe. A group of 6 hikers seen from behind; the camera starts inside the group (0-1 s: close, blurred, heavily overlapping) and they walk away from it. Partly hidden people are boxed by their visible part, and a person hidden almost entirely is left out for that second. The 0 s ids are guesses (h1 there is a red backpack with no head in frame; h2 is a blue blur at the left edge). Scores match boxes per moment, so a wrong id doesn't change them. h1: white cap, blue shirt, red-and-grey backpack. h2: dark cap, light-blue shirt, red backpack, black shorts. h3: dark hair, purple top, lavender shorts, red-and-black backpack. h4: blonde ponytail, pink backpack. h5: curly dark hair, blue shirt, black-and-green backpack. h6: grey shirt, short dark hair, black backpack."
}
